      "description": "Preferred entry for a known file, symbol, shared type, interface, configuration, authentication or persistence target whose change may affect other files. Finds dependencies, hidden consumers and tests plus bounded source before editing. Skip isolated one-file edits, exact source already loaded or simple textual lookups. manifest_only shows costs/structure first; depth controls scope.",
